message: "Si usas este recurso, cítalo con estos datos. If you use this resource, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "La Obra: Optimization and Related Rates Problems in Virtual Reality (WebXR)"
abstract: >-
  Open WebXR resource in which eleven optimization and related rates problems of a
  first-year single-variable calculus course for engineering are recreated at real
  scale in a single virtual world, a construction site. Each station links a
  manipulable three-dimensional situation with a panel of equations and live
  readings, a dynamic graph and a narrated explanation. The interface, the number
  format and the narration are available in Spanish, English and Portuguese. It runs
  in a desktop browser and in standalone headsets such as Meta Quest 3.
